Gnemma the Deaconess~
A female gnome dressed in robes tends the store here, her nose in a prayer book.
~
   Gnemma, the gnome deaconess runs the small clerical shop here.  It allows
her plenty of time for her studies, as well as time to blow up things when she
practices her brewing skills.  A cheery sort, she bows as you enter the shop
and offers you to peruse the wares of the shop.    
~
