Gelfelas, the training chaplain~
The chaplain in charge of your training stands here.
~
   Gelfelas is an elf about five feet tall, with long flowing blonde hair and
almond shaped eyes.  As cleric chaplain, he is here to teach you the many
skills and prayers needed to bring you closer to your god and receive their
blessings.  He is dressed in a long white and black robe, his way of showing
that he favors not good or evil clerics and will teach all.    
~
