the guardian scorpion~
A giant decaying scorpion scuttles from the shadows to prevent your entry.
~
   Truly a nightmare creation, this large scorpion was brought back to life
through the dark prayer of some cleric who worships Morgion, the God of Decay
from the Abyss.  It scuttles quietly from the shadows, watching for those who
do not follow the dark gods in a bid to stop their intrusion on the ceremonies
performed below.    
~
